  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A clean break of your humerus (upper arm bone) is accompanied by a sickening crack. The arm drops limply at your side. Your opponent is no doubt grinning.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.4lj1ik958mbgAlaF]{Broken Bone (Minor)}. Also, until you’ve spent an Action (using your other arm) sticking the broken limb into an improvised mitella or otherwise accomplished some sort of makeshift immobilization (like tucking it into your belt), the dangling extremity will unbalance and discomfort you enough for a -10 penalty to all Agility Tests.</p>"
    },
